msgstr "頁首"

msgid "Footer"
msgstr "頁尾"

msgid "Home page (no title, full width)"
msgstr "首頁（無標題、全寬）"

msgid "Wide page (menu)"
msgstr "寬版頁面（菜單）"

msgid "Midnight"
msgstr "午夜藍"

msgid "Olive"
msgstr "橄欖綠"

msgid "Home: about us"
msgstr "首頁：關於我們"

msgid "Your story in a few lines, with the Instagram button from MenuDash → Restaurant."
msgstr "用幾句話介紹您的故事，並附上 MenuDash → Restaurant 中的 Instagram 按鈕。"

msgid "How to get to the restaurant (MenuDash → Restaurant → Getting here)."
msgstr "如何前往餐廳（MenuDash → Restaurant → 交通）。"

msgid "Footer (address, getting here, opening hours)"
msgstr "頁尾（地址、交通、營業時間）"

msgid "Home: gift cards"
msgstr "首頁：禮券"

msgid "A short teaser with the picture of the card and a button to the gift card page. Shows only while MenuDash takes gift card orders and a page has the gift card form."
msgstr "簡短介紹，附禮券圖片及前往禮券頁面的按鈕。只在 MenuDash 接受禮券訂購且有頁面放了禮券表格時顯示。"

msgid "Gift card page"
msgstr "禮券頁面"

msgid "An introduction and MenuDash's gift card order form ([menudash_giftcard]). Amounts, e-mail address, picture and terms are set under MenuDash → Gift cards."
msgstr "一段介紹及 MenuDash 的禮券訂購表格（[menudash_giftcard]）。金額、電郵地址、圖片及條款在 MenuDash → Gift cards 設定。"

msgid "Header (coloured band)"
msgstr "頁首（彩色橫條）"

msgid "Home: welcome"
msgstr "首頁：歡迎"

msgid "The restaurant's name line, a big headline, the \"open now\" badge and the buttons (menu, reserve, order online; each can be deleted or changed, reserve and order take their links from MenuDash → Restaurant), with a smiling drawing beside it."
msgstr "餐廳名稱、大標題、「營業中」標示及按鈕（菜單、訂位、線上訂餐；每個都可以刪除或修改，訂位和線上訂餐的連結來自 MenuDash → 餐廳資料），旁邊配上笑臉圖案。"

msgid "The opening hours from MenuDash → Hours & holidays."
msgstr "MenuDash → Hours & holidays 中的營業時間。"

msgid "Home: our recommendations"
msgstr "首頁：本店推薦"

msgid "The dishes marked \"Recommended\" in the MenuDash menu, with their photos; they change with the menu by themselves."
msgstr "MenuDash 菜單中標為「推薦」的菜式及其照片，會隨菜單自動更新。"

msgid "Today's specials"
msgstr "今日推薦"

msgid "Today's specials from MenuDash (the second, short CSV), e.g. at the top of the home page."
msgstr "MenuDash 的今日推薦（第二份簡短 CSV），例如放在首頁頂部。"

msgid "Home: what guests say"
msgstr "首頁：客人怎麼說"

msgid "One quote from a guest, a review or an article, with its source; on a coloured band."
msgstr "一段來自客人、評論或文章的引言及出處，放在彩色橫條上。"

msgid "Home: visit us / delivery (with map)"
msgstr "首頁：歡迎來店 / 外送（附地圖）"

msgid "Two ways to your food: come by (address, phone, getting here, directions) or order online (ordering times with \"order now\"), with the map below. Everything comes from MenuDash → Restaurant; without an order link the delivery column goes."
msgstr "兩種享用方式：來店（地址、電話、交通、路線）或線上訂餐（訂餐時間及「現可訂餐」），下方附地圖。全部來自 MenuDash → Restaurant；沒有訂餐連結時，外送欄位不會顯示。"

msgid "Needs MenuDash Restaurant"
msgstr "需要 MenuDash Restaurant"

msgid "Here the address, getting here and opening hours appear once the MenuDash Restaurant add-on is installed."
msgstr "安裝 MenuDash Restaurant 附加元件後，這裡會顯示地址、交通及營業時間。"

msgid "Here the \"open now\" badge, the address and the Reserve and Order online buttons appear once the MenuDash Restaurant add-on is installed."
msgstr "安裝 MenuDash Restaurant 附加元件後，這裡會顯示「營業中」標示、地址，以及訂位和線上訂餐按鈕。"

msgid "With the MenuDash Restaurant add-on this section fills itself: address, phone, getting here, directions, delivery and map, from MenuDash → Restaurant. Until then, write your address here."
msgstr "安裝 MenuDash Restaurant 附加元件後，此區塊會自動填入 MenuDash → Restaurant 中的地址、電話、交通、路線、外送及地圖。在此之前，請在這裡填寫您的地址。"

msgid "Only you see this note, in the editor."
msgstr "此提示只在編輯器中顯示，只有您看得到。"

msgid "Here the \"Follow us on Instagram\" button appears once the MenuDash Restaurant add-on is installed and an Instagram link is entered under MenuDash → Restaurant."
msgstr "安裝 MenuDash Restaurant 附加元件並在 MenuDash → Restaurant 填入 Instagram 連結後，這裡會顯示「在 Instagram 追蹤我們」按鈕。"

msgid "Street and number"
msgstr "街道及門牌號碼"

msgid "Postcode and town"
msgstr "郵遞區號及城市"

msgid "How to get here by tram, bus or car, and when you are open. Replace this text in the editor."
msgstr "如何搭電車、巴士或開車前來，以及營業時間。請在編輯器中替換這段文字。"

msgid "Gift card teaser: shows here while the MenuDash Gift Cards add-on takes orders and a page has the gift card form."
msgstr "禮券介紹：當 MenuDash Gift Cards 附加元件接受訂購且有頁面放了禮券表格時，會顯示在這裡。"

msgid "Delivery: shows here once an order link is entered under MenuDash → Restaurant (MenuDash Restaurant add-on)."
msgstr "外送：在 MenuDash → Restaurant 填入訂餐連結後會顯示在這裡（MenuDash Restaurant 附加元件）。"

msgid "Map: shows here once the address is entered under MenuDash → Restaurant (MenuDash Restaurant add-on)."
msgstr "地圖：在 MenuDash → Restaurant 填入地址後會顯示在這裡（MenuDash Restaurant 附加元件）。"

msgid "Instagram / Facebook: show here once their links are entered under MenuDash → Restaurant (MenuDash Restaurant add-on)."
msgstr "Instagram / Facebook：在 MenuDash → Restaurant 填入連結後會顯示在這裡（MenuDash Restaurant 附加元件）。"

#. translators: the menu page's web address, lower case without spaces (German: speisekarte)
msgctxt "page address"
msgid "menu"
msgstr "menu"

msgid "Provider (legal notice)"
msgstr "網站提供者（法律聲明）"

msgid "Provider: the company name, address, phone and e-mail show here once they are entered under MenuDash → Restaurant (MenuDash Restaurant add-on)."
msgstr "網站提供者：在 MenuDash → Restaurant 填入公司名稱、地址、電話和電子郵件後會顯示在這裡（MenuDash Restaurant 附加元件）。"

msgid "Legal notice"
msgstr "法律聲明"

#. translators: the legal notice page's web address, lower case without spaces (German: impressum)
msgctxt "page address"
msgid "legal-notice"
msgstr "legal-notice"

#. translators: %s: phone number, as a link
msgid "Phone: %s"
msgstr "電話：%s"

msgid "Provider"
msgstr "網站提供者"

msgid "Company name, street and number, postcode and town, phone and e-mail."
msgstr "公司名稱、街道及門牌號碼、郵遞區號及城市、電話和電子郵件。"

msgid "Commercial register: canton or court"
msgstr "商業登記：登記機關"

msgid "Company number: replace with yours (in Switzerland the UID, CHE-…)"
msgstr "公司編號：請換成您的編號（瑞士為 UID，CHE-…）"

msgid "Website"
msgstr "網站"

#. translators: %s: link to insdash.ch
msgid "Design & development: %s"
msgstr "設計與製作：%s"

msgid "Who runs the website (from MenuDash → Restaurant), your company number and who made the website. For a page \"Legal notice\"."
msgstr "網站由誰經營（來自 MenuDash → Restaurant）、您的公司編號，以及網站由誰製作。用於「法律聲明」頁面。"

msgid "Corner picture"
msgstr "角落圖案"

msgid "Picture"
msgstr "圖案"

msgid "Automatic"
msgstr "自動"

msgid "Automatic: the icon from MenuDash → Restaurant, otherwise the ring."
msgstr "自動：使用 MenuDash → Restaurant 中的圖示，否則顯示圓環。"

msgid "Ring"
msgstr "圓環"

msgid "Own picture"
msgstr "自訂圖片"

msgid "No picture"
msgstr "不顯示"

msgid "Choose a picture"
msgstr "選擇圖片"

msgid "Choose another picture"
msgstr "選擇其他圖片"

msgid "Strength (%)"
msgstr "濃度 (%)"

msgid "How clearly the picture shows in the coloured band. Default: 8."
msgstr "圖案在色帶中的明顯程度。預設：8。"

msgid "MenuDash is installed and active. Your menu page is ready."
msgstr "MenuDash 已安裝並啟用。您的菜單頁面已準備好。"

msgid "Upload your menu"
msgstr "上傳菜單"

msgid "MenuDash couldn't be installed."
msgstr "無法安裝 MenuDash。"

#. translators: %s: link to MenuDash on GitHub
msgid "Download menudash.zip from %s and upload it under Plugins → Add New → Upload Plugin."
msgstr "請從 %s 下載 menudash.zip，然後在「外掛 → 安裝外掛 → 上傳外掛」上傳。"

msgid "Activate MenuDash"
msgstr "啟用 MenuDash"

msgid "Install and activate MenuDash"
msgstr "安裝並啟用 MenuDash"

msgid "MenuDash Theme works with the free MenuDash plugin"
msgstr "MenuDash Theme 需搭配免費的 MenuDash 外掛使用"

msgid "Your menu, today's specials, the dishes on the home page and the holiday notice come from MenuDash. Once it is active, the theme makes your menu page."
msgstr "您的菜單、今日推薦、首頁上的菜式和假期通知都來自 MenuDash。啟用後，主題會自動建立菜單頁面。"

msgid "Ask your site's administrator to install it."
msgstr "請聯絡網站管理員安裝。"

msgid "Not now"
msgstr "稍後再說"

msgid "About MenuDash"
msgstr "關於 MenuDash"

msgid "Sorry, you are not allowed to install plugins on this site."
msgstr "抱歉，您沒有權限在此網站安裝外掛。"

msgid "The site can't write to its plugins folder."
msgstr "網站無法寫入外掛資料夾。"

msgid "The download didn't contain MenuDash."
msgstr "下載的檔案中沒有 MenuDash。"

msgid "A new home page with the default layout is now your front page. The old one is still under Pages."
msgstr "已建立使用預設版面的新首頁並設為網站首頁。舊的首頁仍在「頁面」中。"

msgid "Activate"
msgstr "啟用"

msgid "Active"
msgstr "已啟用"

msgid "Add-ons are uploaded under Plugins → Add New → Upload Plugin."
msgstr "附加元件請在「外掛 → 安裝外掛 → 上傳外掛」上傳。"

msgid "Address, opening hours, \"open now\", holiday notice, contact buttons, map."
msgstr "地址、營業時間、「營業中」、假期通知、聯絡按鈕、地圖。"

msgid "As the theme made them"
msgstr "與主題預設相同"

msgid "Back to the default"
msgstr "還原為預設"

msgid "Bring back what the theme made when it was activated. Your own pages are never deleted."
msgstr "還原主題啟用時建立的內容。您自己的頁面永遠不會被刪除。"

#. translators: %s: names of the changed templates, e.g. "Header, Front Page"
msgid "Changed in the Editor: %s"
msgstr "已在編輯器中修改：%s"


msgid "Default layout"
msgstr "預設版面"

msgid "Gift card orders."
msgstr "禮券訂購。"

msgid "Header, footer and templates"
msgstr "頁首、頁尾和範本"

msgid "Home page"
msgstr "首頁"

msgid "How to get it"
msgstr "如何取得"

msgid "Install and activate"
msgstr "安裝並啟用"

msgid "Installed, not active"
msgstr "已安裝，未啟用"

msgid "Make a new home page"
msgstr "建立新首頁"

msgid "Make a new home page with the default layout and show it instead of the current one? The current one stays under Pages."
msgstr "要建立使用預設版面的新首頁並取代目前的首頁嗎？目前的首頁會保留在「頁面」中。"

msgid "Make the menu page"
msgstr "建立菜單頁面"

msgid "Menu page"
msgstr "菜單頁面"

msgid "Missing"
msgstr "缺少"

msgid "Needs MenuDash"
msgstr "需要 MenuDash"

msgid "No home page: the site shows the latest posts."
msgstr "沒有首頁：網站會顯示最新文章。"

msgid "Not installed"
msgstr "未安裝"


msgid "Plugins"
msgstr "外掛"

msgid "Plugins & Layout"
msgstr "外掛與版面"

msgid "Sorry, you are not allowed to change the layout."
msgstr "抱歉，您沒有權限變更版面。"

msgid "The header, footer and templates are back to the theme's default."
msgstr "頁首、頁尾和範本已還原為主題預設。"

msgid "The menu page is made."
msgstr "菜單頁面已建立。"

msgid "The menu, the recommended dishes on the home page, colours. Free."
msgstr "菜單、首頁上的推薦菜式、顏色。免費。"

msgid "The theme shows what you enter in MenuDash. The free MenuDash plugin is needed; each add-on brings more sections."
msgstr "主題會顯示您在 MenuDash 中輸入的內容。需要免費的 MenuDash 外掛；每個附加元件都會增加更多區塊。"

msgid "Today's specials and the lunch menu."
msgstr "今日推薦和午市套餐。"

msgid "Undo all changes to the header, footer and templates? Your pages, menu and colours stay as they are."
msgstr "要復原頁首、頁尾和範本的所有修改嗎？您的頁面、菜單和顏色都不會改變。"

msgid "Which dishes guests look at."
msgstr "客人在看哪些菜式。"

msgid "Where to change what"
msgstr "在哪裡修改什麼"

msgid "Almost everything is in Appearance → Editor. These links open the right place."
msgstr "幾乎所有設定都在「外觀 → 編輯器」中。以下連結會直接開啟對應位置。"

msgid "Logo, top menu, corner picture, holiday notice."
msgstr "標誌、頂部選單、角落圖案、假期通知。"

msgid "Top menu"
msgstr "頂部選單"

msgid "The links in the header (older themes: Appearance → Menus)."
msgstr "頁首中的連結（舊式主題：外觀 → 選單）。"

msgid "Colours and fonts"
msgstr "顏色和字型"

msgid "Colours, fonts, sizes and spacing for the whole site (older themes: Customize, Background)."
msgstr "整個網站的顏色、字型、大小和間距（舊式主題：自訂、背景）。"

msgid "Texts, pictures and the order of the sections."
msgstr "文字、圖片和區塊的順序。"

msgid "Address, opening hours, links at the bottom (older themes: Widgets)."
msgstr "地址、營業時間、頁面底部的連結（舊式主題：小工具）。"

msgid "Sections"
msgstr "區塊"

msgid "The ready-made sections to add to any page (Patterns)."
msgstr "可加入任何頁面的現成區塊（區塊版面配置）。"

msgid "Page layouts"
msgstr "頁面版面"

msgid "How each kind of page is built (Templates)."
msgstr "每種頁面的結構（範本）。"

msgid "Menu, hours and restaurant details"
msgstr "菜單、營業時間和餐廳資料"

msgid "Entered in MenuDash; the theme shows them everywhere."
msgstr "在 MenuDash 中輸入，主題會在各處顯示。"

msgid "Fonts"
msgstr "字型"

msgid "Styles → Typography: the theme's two fonts; the button next to \"Fonts\" adds or uploads others."
msgstr "樣式 → 字體排印：主題的兩種字型；「字型」旁的按鈕可加入或上傳其他字型。"

